  "title": "Carini: Of Men and Museums",
  "summary": "I love museums and I love cars, so it makes sense that I love car museums. Recently, two of my good friends, Jon Oscher and George Barber, passed away. Both founded terrific car museums that are a little off the beaten path but very much worth a visit. If you’re planning on a road trip […]",
